A sewing kit is a tradeskill container with which players may attempt a [[tailoring]] recipe.  A [[loom]] may also be used for this purpose, but the former is portable with limited slots and the latter is stationary in cities and with a larger capacity.  There are multiple types of sewing kits:

== General Sewing Kits ==
* [[Small Sewing Kit]]
* [[Large Sewing Kit]]
* [[Deluxe Sewing Kit]]

== Cultural Sewing Kits ==
These kits are used to craft the varying sets of cultural tailoring armor

* [[Erudite Sewing Kit]]
* [[Feir'Dal Sewing Kit]]
* [[Vale Sewing Kit]]